ock exclusive Halloween rewards and discover spooky surprises across the map!\n\n# GIVEAWAYS AND LIVE EVENTS\nGive away rare seeds, trade with friends and join the wildest VR community! Win exclusive rewards in live events.\n{2021170175493065}\n# NEW HALLOWEEN SKINS\nDress up in spooky new skins! Unlock Halloween bundles, powerful plants and exclusive cosmetics.\n\nBecome a **GRO BRO: https://discord.gg/gro**\n", "short_description": "Plant, Harvest, GRO-w!\n\nA fantasy farming sandbox, where cozy farming meets multiplayer chaos!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://grogame.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AutoVrse", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://grogame.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "28813569088265437"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823279_995545212876101_3483423037983912183_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lZWFpPewXW4Q7kNvwGRb7Xu&_nc_oc=AdpGqAhrlyYipcgTq1YmRKzyLS9lgZdKkSFe6mwlxDUY_dxb-w-RJdC8dvHtq4JcpfY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT7uxe3dV_MrH-zny2EF35MeHGo_ALShmIXfdWoOk